---

### Quick Checklist for Launch

1. ✅ All core pages (Home, Category, Product, Cart, Checkout, Profile) built.  
2. ✅ Responsive design passes Lighthouse ≥ 90.  
3. ✅ Accessibility score ≥ 90.  
4. ✅ Unit & E2E tests pass.  
5. ✅ CI pipeline builds & deploys automatically.  
6. ✅ Analytics & error monitoring set up.  
7. ✅ Security audit completed.  

Once you hit those marks, you’re ready to launch! 🚀

